ummary Lead strategic and operational procurement of milled rice from Thailand Build a strong network of millers, traders and brokers Secure the best combination of price, grain quality, availability and delivery reliability Work with supply chain, shipping lines, container partners and the global team to ensure timely dispatch against business demand \n Key Responsibilities Develop and execute the Thailand rice procurement strategy in line with demand forecasts from the global team Source milled rice through millers, local traders, brokers and intermediaries across key rice-producing belts Track crop cycles, sowing trends, acreage, yield outlook, grain availability and regional supply conditions Monitor local and export prices, competitor buying activity and demand-supply movements to identify the right buying window Execute a balanced mix of spot and contract purchases for supply continuity, competitive pricing and risk coverage Negotiate commercial terms to achieve the best landed value within agreed quality, quantity and delivery requirements Evaluate and strengthen the approved supplier base on quality capability, capacity, reliability, compliance and track record Coordinate sampling, quality evaluation and pre-dispatch checks with QA/QC teams Work with logistics partners, container providers and shipping lines on shipment planning, container availability and timely dispatch Coordinate documentation and shipment readiness, and resolve constraints that may affect delivery commitments Maintain accurate purchase contracts, pricing records, supplier data, market intelligence and procurement MIS Identify supply, quality, price, logistics and counterparty risks, and recommend alternate sources or mitigation actions Build long-term, ethical relationships with millers, traders and brokers, upholding transparency, confidentiality and company policies\n\nKey Skills: Procurement,Supply chain,Management,Rice,Supply,Purchase,Strategic sourcing,Sourcing","role_search":"Supply Chain Manager"},{"title":"Quality Engineer-Packages","company":"IBM","location":"Bangalore","source":"foundit","url":"https://www.foundit.in/job/quality-engineer-packages-ibm-bengaluru-bangalore-69885959","date_posted":"2026-11-22","experience":"","is_walkin":false,"role_search":"Machine Learning Engineer"},{"title":"Hr","company":"Cbseaffiliationno.1730464","location":"Madurai","source":"google_images","url":"https://lookaside.instagram.com/seo/google_widget/crawler/?media_id=4035115929574541417","date_posted":"2026-11-22","experience":"Fresher / Experienced","salary":"Competitive / Best in Industry","is_walkin":true,"walkin_time":"","contact_email":"hr@srpublicschool.edu","contact_phone":"8104275684","flyer_image_url":"https://lookaside.instagram.com/seo/google_widget/crawler/?media_id=4035115929574541417","venue":""},{"title":"Accountant (Tally & Excel)","company":"Gullak Operations","location":"Delhi","source":"naukri","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-accountant-tally-excel-gullak-operations-new-delhi-2-to-4-years-221126000193","date_posted":"2026-11-22","experience":"2-4 Yrs","skills":[33,111],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Responsibilities: Maintain daily Tally entries and vouchers. Manage cash inflow, outflow and expenses. Handle customer deposits and withdrawals. Maintain books, ledgers and bank records. Create Excel dashboards and daily MIS reports.\n\nKey Skills: ERP,Tally,English,Hindi,Microsoft,Tally ERP,Advanced MS Excel,Management","role_search":"Accountant"},{"title":"Hiring Purchasing Buyer","company":"Pexrise Solutions","location":"Pune","source":"naukri","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-hiring-purchasing-buyer-pexrise-solutions-pune-2-to-7-years-271125031695","date_posted":"2026-11-22","experience":"2-7 Yrs","skills":[],"is_walkin":false,"description":"The Purchasing Buyer will manage end-to-end procurement activities, global supplier coordination, and timely sourcing of engineering and industrial components. The role requir